# Client (Vite) build-time config.
#
# LOCAL single-service dev: leave VITE_SERVER_URL UNSET — the client talks to the
# same origin (Vite proxies /socket.io to the local server).
#
# SPLIT DEPLOY: set this in your Vercel project's Environment Variables to the
# Render backend URL (no trailing slash). It is baked into the static build, so
# changing it requires a redeploy.
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://where-to-api.onrender.com
